# Ruthless Radrat: "Squad-Exile four cards from your graveyard." (CR 702.157a) The squad cost is paid any number of times as an
# additional cost, here twice: eight of the nine cards in Bot1's graveyard (a Black Lotus and the eight Lightning Bolts that two
# Satyr Wayfinders put there) are exiled, seven is not enough for two payments, and three payments would need twelve, which
# the graveyard does not hold, so it can't be kicked three times. When the Radrat enters, two tokens that are copies of it
# are created, at once. The cast is paid exactly with a Blasted Landscape's {C} and two Mox Jets, and the pool ends empty.

